  "solution": "**Given:**\n\na = 0.1 + sqrt{0.9}\n\nb = 0.1 - sqrt{0.9}\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\na² + b² = (a + b)² - 2ab\n\n**Calculation:**\n\na + b = (0.1 + sqrt{0.9}) + (0.1 - sqrt{0.9})\n\na + b = 0.2\n\nab = (0.1 + sqrt{0.9})(0.1 - sqrt{0.9})\n\nab = (0.1)² - (sqrt{0.9})²\n\nab = 0.01 - 0.9\n\nab = -0.89\n\n(a² + b² = (a + b)² - 2ab\n\na² + b² = (0.2)² - 2(-0.89)\n\na² + b² = 0.04 + 1.78\n\n⇒ a² + b² = 1.82\n\n**The value of (a² + b²) is 1.82.**",
